  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Starexify/Cosmicore/blob/1.21-neo/src/main/resources/cosmicore_logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Cosmicore 标志\" width=\"4051\" height=\"599\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmicore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcosmicore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmicore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1057420?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=1B3193\" alt=\"CurseForge 下载量\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcosmicore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/I6sYca4V?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=1B3193\" alt=\"Modrinth 下载量\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Starexify/Cosmicore/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Starexify/Cosmicore?style=for-the-badge&color=1B3193\" alt=\"GitHub 问题\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Starexify/Cosmicore/blob/1.21/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/Starexify/Cosmicore?style=for-the-badge&color=1B3193\" alt=\"GitHub 许可证\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstarexify.github.io%252fFnB-Projects%252fsrc%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Starexify/Starexify/b79e6e8e9e0772de98a4584e41476894a655ac0c/resources/Minecraft/Desc/site/cozy_vector.svg\" alt=\"F&amp;B 项目中心\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<h2><strong>ℹ️ 关于</strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<p>Cosmicore 是一款全新的 Minecraft 陨石模组，灵感源自旧版 Falling Meteors 模组的怀旧情怀，但内容更加丰富。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>✨ 特性</strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-width:initial\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:initial;width:22.1898%\"><strong>🏛️ 结构</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:initial;width:77.6412%\">六个陨石坠落遗址，你可以在这里找到新的陨石和背景故事。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:initial;width:22.1898%\"><strong>🪨 新材质</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:initial;width:77.6412%\"><strong>钛</strong>、<strong>六方金刚石</strong>、<strong>火源矿</strong>和<strong>磁铁矿</strong>是新增的材质。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:initial;width:22.1898%\"><strong>⚙️ 机器</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:initial;width:77.6412%\"><strong>新增两台破碎机器</strong>，可将陨石粉碎为矿石碎屑。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:initial;width:22.1898%\"><strong>☄️ 陨石！！</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;border-width:initial;width:77.6412%\">三种新型陨石：<strong>无球粒陨石</strong>、<strong>普通陨石</strong>和<strong>橄榄陨石</strong>。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>🗓️ 计划更新</strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<p>在即将到来的更新中，我们计划添加：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>☄️ <strong>更多陨石！！</strong></li>\n<li>更多的结构</li>\n<li>更多的材质</li>\n<li>更多新机器</li>\n<li>以及更多内容！</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>📜 许可证</strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<p>本模组采用 MIT 许可证授权，允许免费使用、修改和分发，这意味着你可以将其用于你的整合包中。如需了解更多详情，请参阅随模组附带的完整许可证。</p>",
